  "description": "BRISTOL is a Blackletter (Old English) style font that blends a classic feel with a strong, authoritative character. Featuring sharp, bold letterforms and ornaments characteristic of medieval typography, the font exudes elegance, luxury, and prestige. It is ideal for vintage, Gothic, and medieval-themed designs, as well as logos, premium branding, product packaging, posters, album covers, tattoos, and various creative projects requiring a dramatic, distinctive look. With its rich detail and robust structure, BRISTOL creates an iconic and memorable visual identity.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>BRISTOL is a Blackletter (Old English) style font that blends a classic feel with a strong, authoritative character. Featuring sharp, bold letterforms and ornaments characteristic of medieval typography, the font exudes elegance, luxury, and prestige. It is ideal for vintage, Gothic, and medieval-themed designs, as well as logos, premium branding, product packaging, posters, album covers, tattoos, and various creative projects requiring a dramatic, distinctive look. With its rich detail and robust structure, BRISTOL creates an iconic and memorable visual identity.</p>",
